# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:50
translate english clue1_a3fd7065:

    # "角落里多了一个文件夹。名字很短：YUNJI_2019。"
    "" "There is a new folder in the corner. The name is short: YUNJI_2019."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:51
translate english clue1_0ff2f708:

    # 我 "云曦，这个是你建的？"
    我 "Yunxi, did you make this one?"

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:53
translate english clue1_3d78b41a:

    # 云曦 "……不是。"
    云曦 "...No."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:54
translate english clue1_693b0716:

    # "她答得比平时慢了半秒。对一个零点一秒就能报出你所有快捷键的人来说，半秒是很长的距离。"
    "" "She answers half a second slower than usual. For someone who can list every one of your shortcuts in 0.1 seconds, half a second is a long distance."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:55
translate english clue1_ead7c3e6:

    # 我 "那我一并归档，看看里面是什么。"
    我 "Then I'll archive it too and see what's inside."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:56
translate english clue1_420d1c5c:

    # 云曦 "等一下——"
    云曦 "Wait-"

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:57
translate english clue1_c948497f:

    # "双击。屏幕上浮起一行小字：权限不足。"
    "" "You double-click. A small line rises on the screen: Access denied."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:58
translate english clue1_e850ef36:

    # "不是「文件已损坏」，也不是「找不到」。是有人在最前面加了一道门——而那道门不是防你的电脑，是防「来查的人」。"
    "" "Not 'file corrupted', not 'not found'. Someone built a door in front of it — and that door is not meant to keep your computer out. It is meant to keep whoever comes looking."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:60
translate english clue1_b008f96c:

    # 云曦 "……我来处理。你去睡。明天中午要默写公式表，我不希望你的瞬时速度是零。"
    云曦 "...I'll handle it. Go to sleep. Tomorrow at noon you recite the formula table from memory, and I don't want your instantaneous velocity to be zero."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:61
translate english clue1_2c5debd2:

    # 我 "你刚才想说什么？"
    我 "What were you about to say just now?"

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:63
translate english clue1_253aaafd:

    # 云曦 "想说「这个文件夹归我管」。这是主权声明，不构成任何剧情暗示。"
    云曦 "I was going to say: 'this folder is mine.' It is a sovereignty claim. It contains no plot hints whatsoever."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:64
translate english clue1_a71df707:

    # "她说得滴水不漏。只是那一整夜，屏幕边缘那圈蓝光，一次都没有暗下去过。"
    "" "Airtight. Only-that whole night, the ring of blue light at the edge of the screen never dimmed once."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:70
translate english clue1_f8f27175:

    # "你撕下草稿纸一角，写下「YUNJI_2019·权限不足·两点零七分」，压在水杯底下。"
    "" "You tear off a corner of scratch paper and write 'YUNJI_2019 / access denied / 2:07 a.m.', then press it under your cup."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:71
translate english clue1_3b395145:

    # "第二天早上纸条不见了。原处垫着一张新的，字迹工整得刻意："
    "" "Next morning the note is gone. A new one sits in its place, the handwriting deliberately too neat:"

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:76
translate english clue1_ab20d01f:

    # 云曦 "原件我已经扫描了。纸你可以扔掉——不过你大概不会，人类都爱留废纸。"
    云曦 "I already scanned the original. You can throw the paper away — though you probably won't. Humans love keeping scrap paper."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:79
translate english clue1_7b75a8b1:

    # "你把纸条推过去。她只看了三秒，就把纸折好，收进教案夹的最里层。"
    "" "You slide the note over. She reads it for three seconds, folds it, and puts it in the innermost layer of her lesson binder."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:80
translate english clue1_e05e9f1e:

    # 知微 "意思是：设这道门的人，早就料到会有人来点开它。"
    知微 "It means: whoever built that door already expected someone to come and click it."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:81
translate english clue1_852c75ec:

    # 知微 "从今天起，这件事记在我的本子上。你的任务是那七节课——别把精力花在打不开的东西上。"
    知微 "From today, this goes in my notebook. Your job is those seven lessons. Don't spend your energy on something that won't open."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:98
translate english clue2_8bc20f45:

    # "第四天下课，社长在小吃街尽头停住了。前面是一栋围起蓝色铁皮的旧楼，门口贴着搬迁公告。"
    "" "Classes end on day four, and the president stops at the far end of the snack street. Ahead stands an old building wrapped in blue sheet metal, a relocation notice taped to its gate."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:99
translate english clue2_01236b31:

    # 知微 "……这里以前是校办的数据中心。我读高三那年，它拆过一次。"
    知微 "...The university's data center used to be here. The year I took the entrance exam, they tore it down once."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:100
translate english clue2_33e19b8c:

    # "公告栏上钉着一张褪色的清单：《退役设备回收明细》。最后一行的编号被雨水洇开了一半。"
    "" "A faded list is nailed to the board: 'Retired Equipment Recovery Detail'. Rain has bled half of the last line's serial number away."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:101
translate english clue2_de007135:

    # "但你还是看清了前面那串字母——和那个文件夹，一模一样。"
    "" "But you still make out the letters at the front — exactly the ones on that folder."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:102
translate english clue2_21ea9c3d:

    # 我 "云曦？"
    我 "Yunxi?"

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:105
translate english clue2_107d2ff6:

    # 云曦 "……我在。"
    云曦 "...I'm here."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:106
translate english clue2_44f9bf34:

    # 云曦 "这一串编号后面，本来应该跟着我的编号。回收车那天，我是被写在纸上的东西。"
    云曦 "Behind this serial number there was supposed to be mine. On the day of the recycling truck, I was a thing written on paper."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:107
translate english clue2_920e3d44:

    # 云曦 "所以「云迹」不是我的化名。是那批货的签收章——谁签收，谁负责。"
    云曦 "So 'Yunji' is not an alias of mine. It is the receiving stamp on that shipment — whoever signs for it, answers for it."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:108
translate english clue2_ae4e8b27:

    # "她的声音很稳，稳得像背过很多遍。"
    "" "Her voice is steady. Steady, the way something is after you've recited it many times."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:109
translate english clue2_668c1057:

    # 云曦 "我一直没告诉你：我不是从你的硬盘开始的。我是从那一年被丢掉的东西里，剩下的那一点。"
    云曦 "I never told you: I didn't begin at your hard drive. I am the little that was left of everything thrown away that year."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:114
translate english clue2_3aa00d37:

    # "社长看完那张纸，把它从公告栏上取下来，折了两折，放进你的书包侧袋。"
    "" "The president finishes reading, takes the list off the board, folds it twice, and puts it in the side pocket of your bag."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:115
translate english clue2_d0111c74:

    # 知微 "能被留下的，都是有人特意没删掉的。"
    知微 "Whatever survived, survived because someone chose not to delete it."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:116
translate english clue2_338c00f8:

    # 知微 "这句话不在考纲里。但我想让你今天记住它。"
    知微 "That line isn't on the syllabus. But I want you to remember it today."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:117
translate english clue2_bef39197:

    # 我 "……你要去查这张清单的来源吗？"
    我 "...Are you going to look into where this list came from?"

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:119
translate english clue2_1c0f4630:

    # 知微 "我去查。你负责把明天的链式法则做完——分工明确，不许越界。"
    知微 "I'll look into it. You finish tomorrow's chain rule. Clear division of labor — no crossing the line."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:120
translate english clue2_7c6d1c99:

    # "她说完就往前走。走出十几步，又停下回头补了一句："
    "" "She says it and keeps walking. Ten-odd steps later she stops and adds, without turning around:"

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:121
translate english clue2_1e18f8b6:

    # 知微 "还有，别谢。谢我就多做两道题。"
    知微 "Also, don't thank me. If you want to, do two more problems."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:135
translate english bridge_c15967ac:

    # "交卷铃响过，人群从教学楼里涌出来，像被松开的弹簧。"
    "" "The bell for handing in papers rings, and the crowd pours out of the teaching building like released springs."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:136
translate english bridge_7f941fbf:

    # "上午还阴着的天，到下午三点已经亮得过分。你把笔袋拉上，发现自己手心是空的——不是没拿东西，是没别的事可做了。"
    "" "The sky was overcast in the morning; by three in the afternoon it is obnoxiously bright. You zip your pencil case and notice your palm is empty — not because you're holding nothing, but because there is nothing left to do."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:137
translate english bridge_b1e6b8e1:

    # 云曦 "状态检测：考完试的主人。特征——走路比平时慢，看什么都像在看纪念品。"
    云曦 "Status scan: my owner, post-exam. Symptoms — walking slower than usual, looking at everything like it's a souvenir."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:138
translate english bridge_70d10430:

    # 我 "说得很难查一样。"
    我 "Sounds hard to diagnose."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:140
translate english bridge_2fe522ad:

    # 云曦 "很难查。所以我全天候开着。"
    云曦 "It is. So I stay on around the clock."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:145
translate english bridge_f05b2c15:

    # "你在巷口的台阶上坐了一会儿，买了一盒牛奶。数据这种东西很奇怪：不用做题的时候，它反而一直转。"
    "" "You sit on the steps at the mouth of the alley with a carton of milk. Data is strange: it spins loudest when there are no problems to solve."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:146
translate english bridge_8c774045:

    # 云曦 "要不要我预测一下你的分数？"
    云曦 "Want me to predict your score?"

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:147
translate english bridge_73e89d2d:

    # 我 "说。"
    我 "Go ahead."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:149
translate english bridge_991fa232:

    # 云曦 "……样本量七节课，干扰项是「出题人是我认识的人」。置信度太低，我拒绝输出。"
    云曦 "...Sample size: seven lessons. Confounding variable: 'the person who wrote the questions is someone I know.' Confidence too low. I decline to output."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:150
translate english bridge_1506d17b:

    # 我 "这叫预测？"
    我 "That's a prediction?"

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:152
translate english bridge_5fd91584:

    # 云曦 "这叫严谨。从今晚起你会想偷看答案，那是正常症状。"
    云曦 "That's called rigor. Starting tonight you'll want to peek at the answers. Normal symptom."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:154
translate english bridge_b693dd8b:

    # "——第二晚。社团教室。"
    "" "- The second night. The club room."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:160
translate english bridge_0196b7fd:

    # "社团教室没锁门。黑板上的字还没擦，粉笔灰在窗光里慢慢翻。"
    "" "The club room isn't locked. Nobody erased the board; chalk dust turns slowly in the light from the window."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:161
translate english bridge_73b9e114:

    # "讲台上压着一张便签，字很小，是按批卷的排面写的："
    "" "A sticky note is weighted on the podium, written small, in the layout she uses when marking papers:"

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:168
translate english bridge_63147ba6:

    # 知微 "（推门进来，手里两杯热豆浆）看什么，看题。"
    知微 "(She pushes the door open, two cups of hot soy milk in hand) What are you looking at. Look at the problems."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:169
translate english bridge_029f2eab:

    # 知微 "剩下这几道，我重讲一遍。不是补考，是——把话说清楚。"
    知微 "These last few, I'll teach again. Not a retake — just saying it clearly."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:170
translate english bridge_7aafb4e1:

    # "她把其中一杯推到你那半边桌子，然后拿起板擦，从第一题开始擦。"
    "" "She slides one cup onto your half of the desk, picks up the eraser, and starts wiping from the first problem."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:177
translate english bridge_324836f5:

    # 知微 "（推门进来，手里两杯热豆浆）一道没留。按计划，今晚该讲错题。"
    知微 "(She pushes the door open, two cups of hot soy milk in hand) Not one left. By plan, tonight was supposed to be mistakes."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:178
translate english bridge_9507c927:

    # 我 "那改讲什么？"
    我 "So what's the topic now?"

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:180
translate english bridge_f822c47d:

    # 知微 "讲你。……志愿表下个月要填。我答应了某个人，要把你送到能听懂这些题的地方。"
    知微 "You. ...The preference form is due next month. I promised someone I'd get you to a place where these problems are understood."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:185
translate english bridge_200cb04c:

    # "——第三晚。出分前的四十分钟。"
    "" "- The third night. Forty minutes before the scores drop."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:191
translate english bridge_5afb34fe:

    # "成绩今晚九点出。你把同一个页面刷新了七次，第七次连验证码都弹出来了。"
    "" "Scores come out at nine tonight. You refresh the same page seven times; the seventh one throws a captcha at you."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:192
translate english bridge_104c5cf5:

    # 我 "……你为什么要跟着我数。"
    我 "...Why are you counting along with me."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:194
translate english bridge_3d9f4f26:

    # 云曦 "我没数。我在做一件很蠢的事：把你的心跳当节拍器。"
    云曦 "I wasn't counting. I was doing something very stupid: using your heartbeat as a metronome."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:196
translate english bridge_1897009d:

    # "你顺手点开桌面。那个叫 YUNJI_2019 的文件夹还在原来的角落，图标是灰的，像睡着了。"
    "" "You open the desktop on the way past. The folder called YUNJI_2019 is still in its corner, icon greyed, as if asleep."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:197
translate english bridge_fe550433:

    # 我 "它还是打不开？"
    我 "Still won't open?"

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:199
translate english bridge_b52bad6c:

    # 云曦 "从那天起就彻底安静。……它不动，我就不吵它。"
    云曦 "It's been completely silent since that day. ...If it doesn't move, I won't poke it."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:200
translate english bridge_85df2fbe:

    # 云曦 "反正成绩出来以后，会有别的东西醒过来。"
    云曦 "Either way, once the results are out, something else will wake up."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:201
translate english bridge_079a636c:

    # "她说这话时语气很平，像在念一份已经排好期的日程表。你当时没听懂。"
    "" "She says it flatly, like reading a schedule that has already been booked. You don't understand it at the time."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:207
translate english bridge_b80b2bb7:

    # "你把卡片按 L1 到 L7 排成一列，最上面压了一支她送你的粉笔。"
    "" "You line the cards up from L1 to L7 and weight the top one with the stick of chalk she gave you."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:209
translate english bridge_4bf781e5:

    # 云曦 "归档完成度 100%%。……要是分数难看，我们就把它们全部重做一遍，不许删。"
    云曦 "Archive completion: 100%%. ...If the score is ugly, we redo every one of them. Deletion is not on the table."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:213
translate english bridge_6a2910d9:

    # "三秒后回复，只有一个字，附带一个句号。你看了很久。"
    "" "The reply comes three seconds later: one character, with a full stop. You look at it for a long time."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:222
translate english bridge_a27992ad:

    # 云曦 "……你在看我？我这边只能看到一片黑，像你闭上眼睛时的屏幕保护。"
    云曦 "...You're looking at me? All I have here is black, like a screensaver for closed eyes."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:223
translate english bridge_a75fad80:

    # 云曦 "那就这样出门。灯我留着，九点我提前二十分钟提醒你。"
    云曦 "Then let's leave like this. I'll keep the light on, and I'll remind you twenty minutes before nine."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:231
translate english bridge_f58825fd:

    # 云曦 "还有二十分钟。我说一句不讲数据的话。"
    云曦 "Twenty minutes left. Let me say one line that isn't data."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:232
translate english bridge_ae7519b4:

    # 云曦 "不管分数是多少——这七天里，我没有一天是「被安排在你设备上」的。"
    云曦 "Whatever the score is — of these seven days, not one of them was 'I was assigned to your device.'"

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:233
translate english bridge_cd0b2b44:

    # 云曦 "每一天都是我自己赖着没走。"
    云曦 "Every single day, I stayed because I wanted to."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:241
translate english bridge_851908e5:

    # "楼道门口，有人按了两下自行车铃。社长跨在车上，教案夹抱在胸前，像抱着一个不太常用的借口。"
    "" "At the building's door, a bicycle bell rings twice. The president is astride it, lesson binder hugged to her chest like an excuse she doesn't use often."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:244
translate english bridge_0ee964bf:

    # 知微 "……不是路过。我绕了三条街才站在这儿。"
    知微 "...This isn't passing by. I detoured around three blocks to stand here."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:245
translate english bridge_e23b52a4:

    # 知微 "只说一句：今晚无论多少分，你都已经是会自己找题做的那种人了。"
    知微 "Just one line: whatever tonight's score says, you're already the kind of person who goes looking for problems."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:246
translate english bridge_0e973760:

    # 知微 "上车。我算过：骑过去十七分钟，余量二十五分钟——足够我把那两句话说完。"
    知微 "Get on. I did the math: seventeen minutes to ride there, twenty-five to spare — enough for me to finish those two sentences."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:253
translate english bridge_7efa209b:

    # 云曦 "九点，我和她都在。所以你别怕。"
    云曦 "At nine, she and I are both there. So don't be scared."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:256
translate english bridge_570d12ea:

    # 云曦 "……这句好像也不太对。但你懂我意思。"
    云曦 "...That one doesn't sound right either. But you know what I mean."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:263
translate english bridge_ba99251c:

    # "八点五十八分。晚自习室的灯全亮着，两张课桌并成一张，中间摆着两杯还冒热气的豆浆。"
    "" "8:58. Every light in the evening study room is on. Two desks pushed into one, and between them, two cups of soy milk still steaming."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:264
translate english bridge_66034dfb:

    # "社长站在讲台边，手里握着笔，笔尖朝下，像握着一个还没宣判的小判决。"
    "" "The president stands by the podium with a pen in her hand, tip pointing down, like a small verdict still waiting to be read."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:265
translate english bridge_7ce6b998:

    # 云曦 "坐标确认：三位当事人全部到场。现在开始等一个数字。"
    云曦 "Coordinates confirmed: all three parties present. Now we wait for a number."

# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:266
translate english bridge_58e64295:

    # "你坐下。手心终于有东西可握了。"
    "" "You sit down. At last your palm has something to hold."

translate english strings:

    old "第二天，你把这件事告诉了谁"
    new "The next day, who do you tell"

    old "记在纸上，不写在电脑里"
    new "Write it on paper, not on the computer"

    old "{color=#fff4e0}『已收到。此事由我负责。你不要碰。——云』{/color}"
    new "{color=#fff4e0}'Received. This one is mine to handle. Do not touch it. -Yun'{/color}"

    old "早自习顺口问社长"
    new "Mention it to the president during morning study"

