# game/scenes/bridge.rpy:307
translate english clue3_4185265e:

    # "第二次的字迹，是她的。她试过打开自己的过去，试到凌晨三点四十——然后把它锁了回去，一个字都没跟你提。"
    "" "The second entry is written in her own hand. She tried to open her own past, kept trying until 3:40 a.m.-then locked it back up and never told you a word."

